    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="70d166f1-e3e9-599a-a7c1-17b0d6b60d78" activityNameId="c00d78b3-5210-5b8b-a47b-5af3880ebb88" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyethylene terephthalate, granulate, bottle grade, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyethylene terephthalate, granulate, bottle grade, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=c7af8832-9551-38fd-a628-363e6fc17c8e
The polymer process, upstream processes like pX, PTA, and MEG production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Location: EU28 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The dataset represents the production mix of commercial PET production technologies in Europe
Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2015 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: total European nameplate capacity (3.4 x 10^6 t/year)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by CPME member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c7af8832-9551-38fd-a628-363e6fc17c8e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
